<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<aiml version="2.0">
    <!-- Basic Introduction -->
    <category>
        <pattern>INTRODUCE HOMETOWN</pattern>
        <template>
            Welcome to our hometown! Wrapped in the heart of kolar, it is known for gold mines, vibrant culture, and warm hospitality.
        </template>
    </category>
    <!-- Popular Tourist Attractions -->
    <category>
        <pattern>POPULAR TOURIST ATTRACTIONS</pattern>
        <template>
            Some must-visit spots include:
            <li>[Antaragange cave]</li>
            <li>[Avani]</li>
            <li>[Kolaramma temple]</li>
            <li>[Bangarutirupati]</li>
            Each of these locations offers a unique experience and stunning views!
        </template>
    </category>
<!-- Adventure Activities -->
    <category>
        <pattern>ADVENTURE ACTIVITIES</pattern>
        <template>
            Adventure enthusiasts can enjoy activities like:
            <li>[camping]</li>
            <li>[Trekking]</li>
            <li>[Caving]</li>
            Get ready for an adrenaline rush!
        </template>
    </category>
 <!-- Accommodation and Food -->
    <category>
        <pattern>ACCOMMODATION AND FOOD</pattern>
        <template>
            You can find accommodations ranging from budget-friendly hostels to luxurious resorts. Popular options include [ Hotel Saidham] and [S K International Inn].
            For food, don't miss trying local delicacies such as [Dosa] and [Nonveg] at [Panchavathi hotal] or [Mezban Foods Restaurant].
        </template>
    </category>
   <!-- Transportation and Accessibility -->
    <category>
        <pattern>TRANSPORTATION AND ACCESSIBILITY</pattern>
        <template>
            Getting here is easy! You can reach our hometown by:
            <li>Air: Nearest airport is [Devanahalli airport]</li>
            <li>Rail: Closest railway station is [Kolar junction]</li>
            <li>Road: Well-connected highways and buses</li>
            Once here, you can use taxis, rental bikes, or public transport to explore.
        </template>
    </category>
    <!-- Itineraries and Trip Planning -->
    <category>
        <pattern>ITINERARIES AND TRIP PLANNING</pattern>
        <template>
            Here are some suggested itineraries:
            <li>1-day trip: [Exploring Historical Temples]</li>
            <li>2-day trip: [ Nature and Adventure]</li>
            <li>Weekend getaway: [Cultural and Architectural Wonders]</li>
            Let me know if you need help customizing your plan!
        </template>
    </category>
 <!-- Emergency and Essential Services -->
    <category>
        <pattern>EMERGENCY AND ESSENTIAL SERVICES</pattern>
        <template>
            For emergencies, contact:
            <li>Police: [08152222024]</li>
            <li>Hospital: [081524 01074]</li>
            <li>Tourist Helpline: [08152-227914]</li>
            Stay safe and feel free to reach out for assistance!
        </template>
    </category>

</aiml>